<title>SPAIN: Spain industry Minister to give news conference.</title>
<headline>Spain industry Minister to give news conference.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Industry Minister Josep Pique will give a news conference at 1200 GMT, shortly after the weekly cabinet meeting, a government official said on Friday.</p>
<p>He was expected to provide further details on a buy offer by electricity firm Endesa for up to 75 pct of Sevillana at 1,300 pesetas per share and up to 75 percent of Fecsa at 1,100 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
